          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Built for Productivity in Every Application",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Manufacturing facilities, warehouses, and production lines trust EZG to design and build custom conveyor belts, shafts, and docks that move materials efficiently and withstand harsh operating conditions. Each belt conveyor we produce is designed for your specific application, supporting everything from lightweight packaging lines to rugged heavy load transfer.</p><p>Since 1998, we’ve been supplying high quality conveyor belt solutions. Our track record reflects a commitment to fabricating equipment that runs smoothly and lasts long, helping our customers maintain consistent output and reduce downtime.</p>",
