          "settings": {
            "heading": "Strength That Starts With Skilled Welding",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>At EZG Manufacturing, our <a href=\"https://ezgmfg.com/capabilities-2/welding/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">welding expertise </span></a>provides the backbone for durable and reliable material handling solutions. Whether it’s MIG, TIG, stick, robotic, or pulse welding, our certified welders deliver precision-crafted components that meet the highest standards of strength and durability. With advanced techniques and attention to detail, our welding ensures every piece of equipment is built to carry the load.</p>",
